杜拉 Purple Caturra\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理方式：酵素水洗 Enzyme washed （菠萝，百香果天然酵素）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  主产季：8-11月；次产季：3-7月\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39); font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：玫瑰，荔枝，柠檬，果汁感\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  Rose, Lychee，Lemon, Juicy\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" style=\"height: auto !important; text-align: center; width: 578px !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<span style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QsIA9kUXHKZdRI8OvImplKeDtxodLE8W6gSnESyribQuZbG5ia5zFeJsSSwukAae6LicDXHhGAhuv8w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n    关于白山庄园\n   </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n  白山庄园位于慧兰省的圣阿道夫区域, 庄园创立于80年代，现在由第三代Rodrigo Sanchez负责，庄园主要种植粉波旁，瑰夏品种。\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n  白山是一个非常有实验探索精神的庄园，Rodrigo与妻子和一个太阳能科技应用团队一直不断的尝试不同的技术应用在处理加工，发酵，晾晒环节，同时他们也与欧洲的专做肥料的Yara团队一起针对庄园不同的地块与品种来应用不同的肥料来改善土壤。\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 14px;\">\n  白山一年有两个产季，高峰期分别是6-7月与10-11月，也正式由于产季的分散，是的庄园在每次产季有足够的时间去做多种处理方式的批次。\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TT4mx3OrBelicv9GJETEb2Eqz9nzxfpcGRVU5eR41Qz217IWibOLjUQUcbMHkOdZ6I8bUpIEuibdPwg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 14px;\">\n  紫卡杜拉，长成后是深紫色的果子，甜度很高，果皮果胶中可发酵分解的物质较多\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  今年有两个不同的水果处理批次，分别使用了菠萝和百香果，处理过程大致如下：\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  1-先用乳酸菌，酿酒酵母等选定的菌种酵母制作初始的发酵液80L，然后再加入水果（菠萝或者百香果），其中还添加一些糖浆和红糖\n </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  ，\n </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  让这个溶液发酵8天，约190小时。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  2-咖啡鲜果脱皮后，将制成的发酵液一起放入200L的桶中，静置发酵150小时左右，发酵过程监控发酵液的甜度Brix不低于6，或者酸度pH不低于4，保证发酵的结果不会太侧重发酵感而无法展现品种自身的特点。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  3-晾晒时，先阳光下自然晾晒2-3天，然后再转移到遮阴条件下继续干燥15-18天左右完成干燥。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\